unknown values and a line without one:
season = by-date
board = 2d
hints = mistakes
language = system
draughts = international
level = medium
color = white
clock = none

summer: season = summer;board = 2d;hints = mistakes;language = system;draughts = international;level = medium;color = white;clock = none; changed true, board hints moves false
3D: season = summer;board = 2d;hints = mistakes;language = system;draughts = international;level = medium;color = white;clock = none; changed false, board hints moves false
all moves: season = summer;board = 2d;hints = moves;language = system;draughts = international;level = medium;color = white;clock = none; changed true, board hints moves true
Eesti: season = summer;board = 2d;hints = moves;language = et;draughts = international;level = medium;color = white;clock = none; changed true, board hints moves true
by the date: season = by-date;board = 2d;hints = moves;language = et;draughts = international;level = medium;color = white;clock = none; changed true, board hints moves true
